aid_credits_require_payment_confirmation", "expected": "runtime finding (refutes the research claim of immediate settlement): with no payment provider a paid_credits POST leaves the purchased inbound PENDING and the wallet balance at 0; credits settle only after the credit invoice is marked paid (PUT payment_status=succeeded -> PrepaidCreditJob -> ApplyPaidCreditsService), which is exactly the WeKnora Payment-Fact -> Lago-fulfillment seam", "observed": {"balance_before_confirmation_cents": 0, "balance_cents": 5000, "confirm_http_status": 200, "invoice_id": "f8bac971-e431-4533-bb4e-278204e893e8", "note": "no payment provider configured in this lab, mirroring the Community no-provider default; settlement requires the payment fact (PUT payment_status=succeeded)", "payment_status_before": "pending", "settled": true, "settled_within_seconds": 0.0, "spendable_confirmed": true}, "outcome": "pass"}], "cleanup": [{"kind": "wallet", "outcome": "terminated", "target": "13ecf322-e5c5-48b8-91e4-2de362392236"}, {"kind": "customer", "outcome": "deleted", "target": "weknora-t03-cust-2253f4e9-0ecd-4f7a-a83f-a16145b4b392"}, {"kind": "wallet", "outcome": "terminated", "target": "0fd22bec-4597-41ae-a1c3-20e2475ed188"}, {"kind": "customer", "outcome": "deleted", "target": "weknora-t03-cust-60da6177-ee0a-43f8-a65d-dcf6ccda6ca3"}, {"kind": "wallet", "outcome": "terminated", "target": "031fdc54-e603-4d6d-84b9-cd57cb2007ef"}, {"kind": "customer", "outcome": "deleted", "target": "weknora-t03-cust-11ca7bfe-18a0-4f73-bd4b-d94152f500f6"}, {"kind": "wallet", "outcome": "terminated", "target": "5b719cf7-ebc1-4594-9a49-3d117586ab3a"}, {"kind": "customer", "outcome": "deleted", "target": "weknora-t03-cust-8c8fa118-02f1-4126-a4e1-f05bc07e435f"}, {"kind": "wallet", "outcome": "terminated", "target": "bfb2b26e-89e7-473d-9e9c-c36c3d0831c2"}, {"kind": "customer", "outcome": "deleted", "target": "weknora-t03-cust-cd6f74bf-0dc4-4ed4-8234-a377466b7483"}, {"kind": "wallet", "outcome": "terminated", "target"